              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chitaai chiatananetwe chibe ekerugwa, nigo chiarenge chikiro chilifu isato, na amagana atano, na emerongo ene, na isano (3,545).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
